      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Suppose he cheats 10% in his favour both ways: pays for 1000 g but receives 1100 g; later charges for 1000 g but gives 900 g.\nFor the cost of 1000 g, he can sell 1100/900 charged ‘kg-units’ = 1.222..., a 22.22% gain.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
